        <p>It was decided that the delegates present eboull form a general comnaitteo with power to add to their num- ber.</p>
        <p>- TUE OFFICIALS THANKED. Mr FAIRCLOUGH moved a vote of thank Co the Chair- man, Deputy-CU:airman, Treasurer and Secretary. Hs said the officials had done very good work and so far as the committee at the Infirmary was concerned the mem- bers were very well satisfi2d with the results of the labours of the Workingrnen's Committee. As regarded the finances of the Infirmary he was pleased to say that this year the income exceeded the expenditure, but they must not let this have the effect of relaxing their</p>
