        <p>Mk PERD&amp;GE OFFSRED SIR WILFRID LAlonnu.-1 tiontrom cnrrespondent cables I—lt 14 &amp;muted by here that Sir Wilfrid Laurier has received an the,tion that he can have a peerage as his share of d Coronation honours if he will accept it. Should he ttli„B,.° 134 title will probably be Baron Art 13103303% from th 'eunty in Quebec, In which Is his home. The fact st h 0 15 child,eis gives basis for the report.</p>
